"""
Enhanced Multi-Source Market Data Pipeline with Automatic Fallback

This module implements a comprehensive market data pipeline with:
- Multi-source data feeds with intelligent fallback mechanisms
- Real-time health monitoring and circuit breakers
- Kafka streaming integration for event-driven architecture
- Data quality validation and anomaly detection
- Performance optimization and caching
- Comprehensive error handling and recovery

Author: Vincent S. Pereira
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 15 October 2025
"""

